{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>小西灣邨瑞福樓一單位內有女子吊頸身亡。今早（20日）10時許，警方接獲上址住戶報案，指發現女事主在一房間內昏迷。警員到場發現37歲陳姓女子上吊，並已陷入昏迷，當場證實死亡。警方於現場檢獲遺書。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.848903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:02:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:57:57.056204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:26.196803+00:00","content_hash":"caad8903b89a22dde35f94b7c28d420d98037d5863e8bec84b044f3f29c0e49b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}